<br/>
<br/>Look to always wear the highest item level pieces available if they provide agility. This is only not true in the case of trinkets where you will want to look for the maximum defensive benefits.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid Tank</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-feral-druid-tank">Head for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59455/agile-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Agile Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Agile Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is your best in slot helm as a Feral Druid Tank this helm requires the user to be an engineer. While it is recommended to be an engineer as a Feral Druid Tank if you are not an engineer you can look to use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56344/helm-of-numberless-shadows">
<img alt="Helm of Numberless Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_192.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Numberless Shadows</span></a> dropping from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5088/the-stonecore">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Stonecore</span></a> on heroic difficulty.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86931/arcanum-of-the-earthern-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Earthern Ring</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1135/the-earthen-ring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Earthen Ring</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
