<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-feral-druid-tank">Shoulders for Feral Druid Tank</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58134/embrace-of-the-night">
<img alt="Embrace of the Night" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_153.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Embrace of the Night</span></a> is our best pre-raid option as a Feral Druid Tank. Several 346 item level pieces are very similar to one another.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86402/inscription-of-the-earth-prince">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription of the Earth Prince</span></a> from reaching exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
