<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-feral-druid-tank">Trinkets for Feral Druid Tank</h4>Feral Druid Tank loves Stamina so any trinkets that provide Stamina are going to be your strongest. The best that are available pre-raid are going to be <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56347/leaden-despair">
<img alt="Leaden Despair" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest_12252_icon.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leaden Despair</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62471/mirror-of-broken-images">
